title V4.3 - Current pipeline (calibrated gate, partial answers, web app)
direction down
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow

Interfaces [color: gray] {
  Web app rag.web [icon: globe]
  Terminal chat rag.chat [icon: terminal]
  Evaluation rag.eval [icon: clipboard]
}

Understand [color: purple] {
  Follow-up check [shape: diamond, icon: help-circle]
  Rewrite question [icon: edit]
}

Retrieve [color: blue] {
  Vector search top 30 [icon: search]
  Keyword search top 30 [icon: type]
  RRF fusion [icon: git-merge]
  Reranker top 8 [icon: bar-chart-2]
  Neighbour text 250 chars [icon: layers]
}

Postgres pgvector [shape: cylinder, icon: database, color: blue]

Calibration [color: orange] {
  rag.calibrate tune and test split [icon: sliders]
  calibration.json with fingerprint [shape: cylinder, icon: file]
  Relevance gate 0.423 [shape: diamond, icon: filter]
}

Evidence [color: green] {
  Number sentences of top 6 sources [icon: list]
  LLM picks up to 10 sentence IDs [icon: message-circle]
  Code looks up exact quotes [icon: code]
}

Answer [color: purple] {
  LLM answers from quotes only [icon: message-circle]
  Drop mixed-in refusal sentences [icon: scissors]
}

Verify [color: orange] {
  Split into sentences [icon: align-left]
  Exact quote match [icon: check]
  Cite uncited sentences from closest quote [icon: link]
  Batch LLM fact check [icon: shield]
  Remove unsupported sentences [icon: trash]
}

Refusal [icon: x-octagon, color: red]

Web app rag.web > Follow-up check: question + history
Terminal chat rag.chat > Follow-up check
Evaluation rag.eval > Follow-up check
Follow-up check > Rewrite question: refers back
Follow-up check > Vector search top 30: standalone
Rewrite question > Vector search top 30
Rewrite question > Keyword search top 30
Vector search top 30 <> Postgres pgvector
Keyword search top 30 <> Postgres pgvector
Vector search top 30 > RRF fusion
Keyword search top 30 > RRF fusion
RRF fusion > Reranker top 8: 24 candidates
Reranker top 8 > Relevance gate 0.423
rag.calibrate tune and test split > calibration.json with fingerprint
calibration.json with fingerprint > Relevance gate 0.423: threshold, stale warning
Relevance gate 0.423 > Refusal: best score below gate
Relevance gate 0.423 > Neighbour text 250 chars
Neighbour text 250 chars > Number sentences of top 6 sources
Number sentences of top 6 sources > LLM picks up to 10 sentence IDs
LLM picks up to 10 sentence IDs > Code looks up exact quotes: IDs like 2.5
Code looks up exact quotes > Refusal: no valid evidence
Code looks up exact quotes > LLM answers from quotes only: verified quotes
LLM answers from quotes only > Drop mixed-in refusal sentences
Drop mixed-in refusal sentences > Split into sentences
Split into sentences > Exact quote match
Split into sentences > Cite uncited sentences from closest quote
Exact quote match > Remove unsupported sentences: accepted
Cite uncited sentences from closest quote > Batch LLM fact check
Split into sentences > Batch LLM fact check: other sentences
Batch LLM fact check > Remove unsupported sentences
Remove unsupported sentences > Refusal: nothing supported left
Remove unsupported sentences > Web app rag.web: answer, citations, verdicts
